<title>MOROCCO: European bank lends Morocco $42.5 million.</title>
<headline>European bank lends Morocco $42.5 million.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Investment European Bank granted Morocco a $42.5 million to finance a water project in the city of Marrakech, the European Union Commission office said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The 18-year-loan was given with a 2.6 percent interest rate and a six-year grace period, the office said in a statement.</p>
</text>
